## MCP Tools Reference

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `find_bulletins_for_period(start_year, end_year)` | Narrow down files to a year range — call this first |
| `search_files(keyword, filenames, context_lines)` | Search within a pre-filtered list of files |
